e un amico con il quale spingersi nelle profondità delle terre selvagge. Qui sentirà sempre più forte Il richiamo della foresta e si unirà a un branco di lupi, senza però dimenticare l'affetto per il suo anziano padrone.","tagline":"Tratto dal leggendario romanzo"},{"language":"en-US","overview":"Buck is a big-hearted dog whose blissful domestic life is turned upside down when he is suddenly uprooted from his California home and transplanted to the exotic wilds of the Yukon during the Gold Rush of the 1890s. As the newest rookie on a mail delivery dog sled team—and later its leader—Buck experiences the adventure of a lifetime, ultimately finding his true place in the world and becoming his own master.","tagline":"Based on the legendary novel."}],"images":{"logos":[],"posters":[],"backdrops":[]},"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/mncsiC33MX8OtsL07DwllLLfJJD.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/1GZCV0dwIoAn6jpWPfVAbeMTVC2.jpg","seasons":[],"schema":{}}},"artworkLibrary":{"tmdb":{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","id":481848,"type":"movie","originalLanguage":"en-US","series":{"poster":{"it":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/mncsiC33MX8OtsL07DwllLLfJJD.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/mncsiC33MX8OtsL07DwllLLfJJD.jpg","language":"it","width":2000,"height":3000},"candidates":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/mncsiC33MX8OtsL07DwllLLfJJD.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/mncsiC33MX8OtsL07DwllLLfJJD.jpg","language":"it","width":2000,"height":3000},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/eqP52ngVTRRVdMivhgvTQ7RnLjc.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/eqP52ngVTRRVdMivhgvTQ7RnLjc.jpg","language":"it","width":1000,"height":1429},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/8C3CwKEbczxxKLq86mWvDSfTFmH.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/8C3CwKEbczxxKLq86mWvDSfTFmH.jpg"